ind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、神祇、馬匹、校勘或未定稱呼保留；不補名字、成員或闕代，故事說詞不作真孤被殺證據。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"繆王","kind":"person","person_id":"2cx_p6z_4uc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"繆王","kind":"person","person_id":"2cx_p6z_4uc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"造父","kind":"person","person_id":"maz_aq2_t5g_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0045","start":45,"end":48,"surface":"西王母","kind":"person","person_id":"4t4_ojw_dn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0055","start":55,"end":58,"surface":"徐偃王","kind":"person","person_id":"cya_zvr_rpv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"繆王","kind":"person","person_id":"2cx_p6z_4uc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0069","start":69,"end":72,"surface":"徐偃王","kind":"person","person_id":"cya_zvr_rpv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m004-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"造父","kind":"person","person_id":"maz_aq2_t5g_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:p053","text":"歴唐堯於崇山兮，過虞舜於九疑。紛湛湛其差錯兮，雜遝膠葛以方馳。騷擾𧘂蓯其相紛挐兮，滂濞泱軋灑以林離。鑽羅列聚叢以蘢茸兮，衍曼流爛壇以陸離。徑入靁室之砰磷鬱律兮，洞出鬼谷之崫礨嵬䃶。遍覽八紘而觀四荒兮，朅渡九江而越五河。經營炎火而浮弱水兮，杭絕浮渚而渉流沙。奄息總極氾濫水嬉兮，使靈媧鼓瑟而舞馮夷。時若薆薆將混濁兮，召屏翳誅風伯而刑雨師。西望崑崙之軋沕洸忽兮，直徑馳乎三危。排閶闔而入帝宮兮，載玉女而與之歸。舒閬風而搖集兮，亢烏騰而一止。低囘陰山翔以紆曲兮，吾乃今目睹西王母皬然白首。載勝而穴處兮，亦幸有三足烏爲之使。必長生若此而不死兮，雖濟萬世不足以喜。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m053-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"唐堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m053-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"虞舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m053-0139","start":139,"end":141,"surface":"靈媧","kind":"person","person_id":"5rm_bw1_128","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"服虔明釋靈媧女媧；僅採本篇具名神話角色身份，不從古注伏犧作琴推親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m053-0145","start":145,"end":147,"surface":"馮夷","kind":"person","person_id":"ycv_m0m_vbr","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"服虔明稱馮夷河伯字；保留字稱為古注解釋，不填現代式姓名組件或歷史官職。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m053-0158","start":158,"end":160,"surface":"屏翳","kind":"person","person_id":"c4x_npm_q9n","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"應劭稱天神使，按具名神話角色登記；不把使視為可紀年的歷史職位。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m053-0161","start":161,"end":163,"surface":"風伯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m053-0165","start":165,"end":167,"surface":"雨師","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m053-0196","start":196,"end":198,"surface":"玉女","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m053-0233","start":233,"end":236,"surface":"西王母","kind":"person","person_id":"4t4_ojw_dn7","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"與《趙世家》造父西巡所見西王母及《大宛列傳》所載安息長老傳聞暫接同一神話人物；保留本篇賦辭，不作歷史親見證明。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru","book_id":"b-shiji-117","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji117-xiangru"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p013","text":"條枝在安息西數千里，臨西海。暑溼。耕田，田稻。有大鳥，卵如甕。人眾甚多，往往有小君長，而安息役屬之，以為外國。國善眩。安息長老傳聞條枝有弱水、西王母，而未嘗見。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m013-0039","start":39,"end":42,"surface":"小君長","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m013-0059","start":59,"end":63,"surface":"安息長老","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m013-0071","start":71,